<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH REAL AUGUST PPI RISES 4.2 PCT YR/YR - CSU.</title>
<headline>CZECH REAL AUGUST PPI RISES 4.2 PCT YR/YR - CSU.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech real industrial producer</p>
<p>prices rose 0.2 percent in August, putting prices 4.2 percent</p>
<p>higher than in the same month in 1995, the Czech Statistical</p>
<p>Bureau (CSU) said on Thursday.</p>
<p> CZECH PRODUCER PRICES    AUG 1996    JULY 1996    AUG 1995</p>
<p>Industrial</p>
<p>  pct change month/month +0.2	    +0.2	    +0.4</p>
<p>  pct change year/year   +4.2	    +4.4	    +7.8</p>
<p>Construction prices</p>
<p>  pct change month/month +0.7	    +0.7	    +0.5</p>
<p>  pct change year/year   +10.9	  +11.2	    +9.5</p>
<p>Agricultural prices</p>
<p>  pct change month/month  n/a	    n/a		 n/a</p>
<p>  pct change year/year  +20.7	   +8.8		-1.8</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
